#File: IndexImportMediawiki_p.html
#---------------------------
No import thread is running, you can start a new thread here==Nessun thread di importazione è in esecuzione, puoi avviare un nuovo thread qui
"Import MediaWiki Dump"=="Importa dump MediaWiki"
When the import is started, the following happens:==Quando l'importazione è iniziata, avviene quanto segue:
The dump is extracted on the fly and wiki entries are translated into Dublin Core data format. The output looks like this:==The dump is extracted on the fly and wiki entries are translated into Dublin Core data format. The output looks like this:
Each 10000 wiki records are combined in one output file which is written to /DATA/PACKS/load into a temporary file.==Each 10000 wiki records are combined in one output file which is written to /DATA/PACKS/load into a temporary file.
When each of the generated output file is finished, it is renamed to a .xml file==Quando ciascun file di output generato e completato, viene rinominato in file .xml
Each time a xml pack file appears in /DATA/PACKS/load, the YaCy indexer fetches the file and indexes the record entries.==Ogni volta che un file pack XML appare in /DATA/PACKS/load, l'indicizzatore YaCy recupera il file e indicizza le voci dei record.
When a pack file is finished with indexing, it is moved to /DATA/PACKS/loaded==When a pack file is finished with indexing, it is moved to /DATA/PACKS/loaded
You can recycle processed pack files by moving them from /DATA/PACKS/loaded to /DATA/PACKS/load==You can recycle processed pack files by moving them from /DATA/PACKS/loaded to /DATA/PACKS/load
